              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ,  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{11\\pi}{6}\"></span>  и  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T09:36:40.857428+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Урав­не­ние опре­де­ле­но для тех зна­че­ний пе­ре­мен­ной, при ко­то­рых  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\tg x\\gt 0\"></span>. Для таких зна­че­ний <i>x</i> чис­ли­тель дроби дол­жен быть равен нулю:<center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"(81^{\\left|\\cos x\\right|})^{\\sin x}-9^{\\sqrt{3}\\sin x}=0\\iff 3^{4\\left|\\cos x\\right|\\sin x}=3^{2\\sqrt{3}\\sin x}\\iff 4\\left|\\cos x\\right|\\sin x=2\\sqrt{3}\\sin x\\iff 2\\left|\\cos x\\right|\\sin x-\\sqrt{3}\\sin x=0\\iff 2\\left|\\cos x\\right|-\\sqrt{3}=0\\iff \\left|\\cos x\\right|=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\iff \\cos x=\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\iff x=\\pm \\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </span></p></center><p> Усло­вию  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\tg x\\gt 0\"></span> удо­вле­тво­ря­ют числа <span data-inline-latex=\"x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\pi k\"></span>. </p></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">От­бе­рем корни при по­мо­щи двой­но­го не­ра­вен­ства:<center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"-2\\pi\\le \\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\pi k\\le -\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\iff -2\\frac{1}{6}\\le k\\le -\\frac{2}{3}\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}k=-1\\\\k=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . . </p></center><p> Най­ден­ным зна­че­ни­ям <i>k</i> со­от­вет­ству­ют корни  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{11\\pi}{6}\"></span>  и  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </p></li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
